      },
      "message": "Initial release: measured Mac results, scripts, tierpack tool, docs\n\nQwen3.8-Flash-Next on an M3 Max with 48 GB, with stock llama.cpp (Metal):\n- Q2_0 (35 GiB) 34-36 tok/s real text, 431 tok/s on an 18,837-token prompt\n- Coder IQ1_M 32 tok/s\n- IQ3_XXS / IQ4_XS do not work usefully on 48 GB (measured, with logs)\n\ntierpack.py re-lays a GGUF by memory tier (GPU part, per-layer experts,\nlookup table). Verified byte-identical on real Q2_0 files. Docs follow\nStrata's structure; every number traces to bench/results/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X8XtX8bkp4NTK8mfQgeSVB",
